Subject: [PATCH] Admit multicast IDs without changing another group owner

Reserve broadcast ID0, match semantic addresses, bound reference changes and
propagate allocator errors. Retry or discard failed host memberships, and never
retarget a source to an unadmitted helper ID. Validate helper IDs before narrowing.
Deferred firmware membership lifetime and VLAN/source-filter ownership are separate.

--- a/wireless/driver/shared/hw_mmb.c
+++ b/wireless/driver/shared/hw_mmb.c
@@ -8754,6 +8754,99 @@
